## 7. Monitoring & Evaluation

### Key Metrics
- **Quality**: Human approval rate, revision iterations needed
- **Efficiency**: Time per stage, total cycle time
- **Consistency**: Agreement between agents on recommendations
- **Learning**: Improvement in approval rate over time

### Logging Strategy
- Log all agent inputs/outputs
- Track decision paths
- Record human feedback
- Monitor system performance

---

## 8. Success Criteria

✓ All user requirements addressed in final plan
✓ Human approval on first submission ≥ 80%
✓ Total cycle time < 24 hours
✓ Plan is executable and realistic
✓ Reflection loop converges within 3 iterations
✓ System learns from feedback patterns

---

## 9. Common Challenges & Solutions

| Challenge | Solution |
|-----------|----------|
| Agent disagreement | Implement consensus algorithm with Reflection Agent mediation |
| Slow execution | Use parallel processing for independent agents |
| Human bottleneck | Set SLA for approvals; escalate if exceeded |
| Poor reflection | Improve feedback parsing; add context to suggestions |
| Infinite loops | Set max iterations and escalation rules |

